>         laser3si        9100/tcp

Two different printers setup using tcp (an HP4m+ and a Lexmark 1200n)

lp2|2:\
        :af=/usr/adm/lp2acct:\
        :ct=tcp:\
        :if=/usr/lbin/hplaser4psof:\
        :lf=/usr/adm/lp2err:\
        :lp=@inpon/inpon_9100:\
        :mx#0:\
        :of=/usr/lbin/hplaser4psof:\
        :pl#66:\
        :pw#80:\
        :rw:\
        :sd=/usr/spool/lpd2:\
        :xf=/usr/lbin/xf:
