enviroment variable "boot_osflags":

P00>>>show  boot_osflags
boot_osflags            a      

If the character "a" is not set, you will not boot multi-user.  To set
it:

P00>>>set boot_osflags a

and then boot.

Tony V.
Unix Base Kernel Group



