Since the tru64 newsgroup does not seem to be propagating everywhere
yet, I'm reposting this here on osf1:

> Does anybody here know how to get Samba 2.0.6 running in Tru64 5.0?
>
> On our system './configure' aborts with:
>
>     ...long list of other checks ommitted...
>     checking configure summary
>     configure: error: summary failure. Aborting config


Found the cure: the Tru64 Standard Header files must be installed.

These header files are not installed by default on a minimal Tru64
installation. To install them, run Sysman > Install Software, and
mount the 'v5 Operating System Volume 1' cdrom.

cheers,

-matt


