To place more than 4GB on a DDS-2 tape, you need to use a tape drive that can
handle DDS-2 tapes.  The TLZ06 can use up to a 90m DDS-1 tape.  It can do 2GB
without compression, and (assuming 2-1 compression) 4GB with compression.

        Stu



