The device name for the parallel port is /dev/lp

Example:

lp|lp0|0|priv:\
        :af=/usr/adm/lpacct:\
        :lf=/usr/adm/lperr:\
        :lp=/dev/lp0:\
        :mx#0:\
        :of=/usr/spool/lpf/ps2lpt:\
        :pl#72:\
        :pw#80:\
        :sd=/usr/spool/lpd:\
        :sh:
Here is a HP LJIIIP Printer connected to the parallel port
from a PW 500au.
Hope it helps.

Joerg-Uwe 
